                    "2 mo",
                    "2.3",
                  ],
                ],
                "sortByScore": false,
                "type": "table",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c08",
            "title": "RICE Prioritisation",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "<p>We'll leverage WhatsApp as a <strong>dual-purpose channel</strong> — first, to deliver bite-sized, conversational product education (interactive tutorials, rich media demos, and targeted tips) that helps devotees discover and understand all puja services; and second, to enable <strong>seamless inbound booking requests</strong> directly within the chat interface, so users can simply message or tap menu options to schedule, personalize, and confirm their puja without ever leaving WhatsApp.</p>",
                "id": "c09-b1",
                "style": "lead",
                "type": "text",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li><strong>Product Education via WhatsApp:</strong> Bite-sized, conversational tutorials and rich media demos delivered in-chat to drive discovery and awareness.</li><li><strong>Puja Booking Service via WhatsApp:</strong> Users tap a menu → browse top pujas → select package → pay via deep-link → confirmation + tracking on WhatsApp. TAT from tap to confirmation: 60 seconds.</li></ul>",
                "id": "c09-b2",
                "type": "list",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c09",
            "title": "WhatsApp Integration",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "<p>Introducing a <strong>dedicated video section</strong> where devotees can endlessly scroll through immersive clips — creating session depth & improving engagement. By showcasing pujas, rituals, and Chadhavs in action, this video-led discovery format meets modern users' evolving browsing habits. Just as Meesho's in-app video feed lets shoppers see products in use and builds trust before purchase, our videos will foster <strong>authenticity and confidence</strong> in every puja experience.</p>",
                "id": "c10-b1",
                "style": "lead",
                "type": "text",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c10",
            "title": "Video Feed",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "<p>We'll gently collect key details — Gotra, birthdays, anniversaries, children's information — at right moments in the app (e.g., when user clicks on puja), always explaining the benefit. By collecting relevant info we deliver truly relevant puja recommendations, build trust, and avoid overload.</p>",
                "id": "c11-b1",
                "style": "lead",
                "type": "text",
              },
              {
                "body": "Cold-Start (No User Data)",
                "id": "c11-b2",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li><strong>Show local favorites:</strong> Detect the user's location to highlight the most-booked pujas in their city or region.</li><li><strong>Feature upcoming & seasonal events:</strong> Surface major monthly pujas and festivals (e.g., Navratri, Sankashti) so newcomers see timely, relevant offerings.</li><li><strong>Highlight platform trends:</strong> 'What's Trending' strip showcasing pujas with high view or booking counts across all users, building social proof and driving initial engagement.</li></ul>",
                "id": "c11-b3",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "When User Data Is Available",
                "id": "c11-b4",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li><strong>Leverage profile attributes:</strong> Pull in Gotra, birthdates, anniversaries and astrological details to surface rituals that align with heritage and life events.</li><li><strong>Tailor to important dates:</strong> Analyse their important days and suggest relevant pujas.</li><li><strong>Build a dynamic 'For You' carousel:</strong> Continuously updated with new recommendations — 'Based on your last Ganesh Puja' or 'Anniversary special for 5 years of devotion.' Incorporates past booking data and app interaction.</li></ul>",
                "id": "c11-b5",
                "type": "list",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c11",
            "title": "Puja Recommendation Engine",
          },
        ],
        "todo": [
          "prototype-link",
        ],
