            "label": "IAP conversion (2.5% → 3.5%)",
            "type": "target",
            "value": "3.5%",
          },
          {
            "id": "o3",
            "inStrip": true,
            "label": "MAU target (6.5M → 8.8M)",
            "type": "target",
            "value": "8.8M",
          },
          {
            "id": "o4",
            "inStrip": false,
            "label": "MAU in 12mo",
            "type": "target",
            "value": "+1.35×",
          },
        ],
        "overview": {
          "company": "Word Trip · Playsimple",
          "kind": "study",
          "summary": "Streamlined onboarding + IAP optimization + retention mechanics to unlock #3 app store ranking and 1.35x MAU growth",
          "title": "Word games monetisation strategy",
          "topics": [
            "Monetization",
            "Retention",
            "Mobile",
            "Games",
            "Engagement",
          ],
        },
        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "seo": {},
        "settings": {
          "redirectOldSlug": false,
        },
        "story": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "<p>WordTrip is a word puzzle game that combines elements of crosswords and word searches with travel-themed visuals and progression. The game primarily monetizes through <strong>in-app purchases and advertising</strong>. Current position: <strong>#5 by revenue (~$500K/mo) with 6.5M MAU</strong>. Word Escapes generates 4.4× more revenue with only 1.7M incremental users — this is not a user acquisition problem, it's a <strong>monetization and retention gap</strong>.</p>",
                "id": "c01-b1",
                "style": "lead",
                "type": "text",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c01",
            "title": "Word Trip Overview",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "Game Comparison",
                "id": "c02-b1",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<p>MAU · Monthly Revenue · App Store Ranking · Rating</p>",
                "id": "c02-b2",
                "style": "body",
                "type": "text",
              },
              {
                "columns": 3,
                "id": "c02-b3",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "note": "MAU: 6.5M · Revenue: ~$500K/mo · App Store: #62 · Play Store: #23 · Rating: 4.6/4.4
Current baseline — lowest revenue per user in category",
                    "title": "Word Trip",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "MAU: 8.2M · Revenue: ~$2.2M/mo · App Store: #6 · Play Store: #9 · Rating: 4.8/4.5
Primary benchmark — 4.4× revenue on 1.7M more users",
                    "title": "Word Escapes",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "MAU: 13.8M · Revenue: ~$2.7M/mo · App Store: #51 · Play Store: #21 · Rating: 4.5/3.5
Largest MAU — strong social features and multi-format",
                    "title": "Words With Friends (Zynga)",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "MAU: 7.5M · Revenue: ~$500K/mo · App Store: #23 · Play Store: #136 · Rating: 4.8/4.6
Comparable MAU to Word Trip; similar revenue — sentence completion adds variety",
                    "title": "Word Connect",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "MAU: 5.2M · Revenue: ~$400K/mo · App Store: #36 · Play Store: #56 · Rating: 4.5/4.5
Lower MAU but better IAP strategy — milestone-based monetization",
                    "title": "Word Cookies",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "MAU: N/A · Revenue: ~$300K/mo · App Store: #10 · Play Store: #8 · Rating: 4.9/4.8
Highest rating — localization success story (60M installs in 18mo via Russia/Turkey)",
                    "title": "Words of Wonders",
                  },
                ],
                "type": "cards",
              },
              {
                "body": "Top Performer Benchmarks",
                "id": "c02-b4",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<p>Industry benchmarks for mobile word games (GameAnalytics)</p>",
                "id": "c02-b5",
                "style": "body",
                "type": "text",
              },
              {
                "columns": 3,
                "id": "c02-b6",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "note": "Up to 43–50%
Word Trip baseline: ~35%",
                    "title": "Day 1 Retention",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "Up to 18–35%
Word Trip baseline: ~18%",
                    "title": "Day 7 Retention",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "Up to 20–29%
Word Trip baseline: ~12%",
                    "title": "Day 28 Retention",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "~3–5%
Word Trip baseline: ~2.5%",
                    "title": "IAP Conversion Rate",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "Up to 27–45 minutes
Word Trip baseline: ~15 min",
                    "title": "Session Length",
                  },
                  {
                    "note": "Up to $10
Mobile game analytics benchmark",
                    "title": "ARPPU",
