            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c04",
            "title": "RICE Prioritisation",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "<p><strong>Current Position:</strong> Word Trip is the #5 player in the word games category. <strong>Target Position:</strong> Reach #3 within 12 months. The strategy leverages Word Trip's unique travel theme as differentiation while filling competitive gaps in formats, retention, and monetization.</p>",
                "id": "c05-b1",
                "style": "lead",
                "type": "text",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li><strong>Travel Companions:</strong> Friend system framed as 'travel buddies' who can assist with hints or play together. Ability to send postcards (messages/challenges) from unlocked destinations.</li><li><strong>Travel Rewards Economy:</strong> Convert traditional coins/gems into 'miles' redeemable for game benefits. Premium 'expeditions' for IAP purchases taking players to exclusive destinations. Travel-themed power-ups (e.g., 'Local Guide' for hints, 'Translation Book' for word reveals).</li><li><strong>Fill competitive gaps:</strong> Multiple game formats and retention mechanics to match top performers.</li><li><strong>Monetization innovation:</strong> Personalized IAP bundles based on user behaviour and spend patterns.</li><li><strong>New Market Expansion:</strong> Identify new markets for localized experiences — inspired by Words of Wonders gaining 60 million installs in 18 months through localization for Russia and Turkey.</li></ul>",
                "id": "c05-b2",
                "type": "list",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c05",
            "title": "Market Share Positioning Strategy",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "Growth Targets",
                "id": "c06-b1",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
