            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c06",
            "title": "Expected Growth Metrics",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "Onboarding Optimization",
                "id": "c07-b1",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Reduce clicks from 5 to 2 (game demo → optional account creation)</li><li>A/B test streamlined flows</li><li>Implement progressive permission requests at different milestones</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> First-time user conversion: 65% → 85% · Day 1 retention</li></ul>",
                "id": "c07-b2",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "IAP Strategy Revamp",
                "id": "c07-b3",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Reorganize IAP bundles (most popular/best value first)</li><li>Implement timed exclusive offers</li><li>Add 'Restore Purchase' option</li><li>Improve bundle naming focused on value</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> IAP conversion rate: 2.5% → 3.1% · Total IAP purchases</li></ul>",
                "id": "c07-b4",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "Ad Strategy Optimization",
                "id": "c07-b5",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Reduce ad frequency in first 3 sessions</li><li>Implement rewarded video ads with valuable rewards</li><li>Optimize ad placement based on user journey & milestones</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> Ad revenue per DAU · 7-day retention</li></ul>",
                "id": "c07-b6",
                "type": "list",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c07",
            "title": "Q1 Roadmap: Onboarding & Monetization",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "Multiple Game Format Introduction",
                "id": "c08-b1",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Add 'Word Puzzles' format from level 1</li><li>Introduce 'Daily Challenge' with rotating formats</li><li>Create seamless navigation between game types</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> Average session time · Average sessions per day</li></ul>",
                "id": "c08-b2",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "Retention Mechanisms",
                "id": "c08-b3",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Implement global and friends leaderboards</li><li>Add daily milestone system with rewards encouraging users to login</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> 30-day retention · DAU/MAU ratio</li></ul>",
                "id": "c08-b4",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "Social Features Phase 1",
                "id": "c08-b5",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Add word challenges between friends</li><li>Create social sharing for achievements</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> Average sessions duration · Social feature engagement</li></ul>",
                "id": "c08-b6",
                "type": "list",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c08",
            "title": "Q2 Roadmap: Game Expansion & Engagement",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "Live Ops & Seasonal Events",
                "id": "c09-b1",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Implement seasonal event framework</li><li>Add limited-time rewards and collections</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> Event participation rate · Revenue during events</li></ul>",
                "id": "c09-b2",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "Personalization Engine",
                "id": "c09-b3",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Implement user segmentation based on behaviour</li><li>Create personalized & dynamic IAP bundles</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> IAP conversion for targeted segments · Retention rate</li></ul>",
                "id": "c09-b4",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "New Market Expansion Research",
                "id": "c09-b5",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Do market study of new markets for word games</li><li>Create capabilities to support localised experience</li><li>Formulate GTM for targeted new markets</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> Total addressable market expansion</li></ul>",
                "id": "c09-b6",
                "type": "list",
              },
            ],
            "hidden": false,
            "id": "c09",
            "title": "Q3 Roadmap: Monetization & Live Ops",
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "body": "Advanced Game Formats",
                "id": "c10-b1",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Add 'Word Wheel', 'Sentence Completion', 'Wordle' and other high-engaging word game formats</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> New user growth: +15% · Cross-format engagement: 30% of users</li></ul>",
                "id": "c10-b2",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "Social Features Phase 2",
                "id": "c10-b3",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Implement PvP word battles</li><li>Add different game formats for PvP battles</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> Social feature engagement · Retention rate · Average session time</li></ul>",
                "id": "c10-b4",
                "type": "list",
              },
              {
                "body": "Market Expansion 2",
                "id": "c10-b5",
                "type": "heading",
              },
              {
                "body": "<ul><li>Integrate Local Payment Methods</li><li>Run targeted regional campaigns</li><li>Launch localised leaderboards</li><li>Launch Regional Live Events</li><li>ASO for new markets</li><li><em>KPIs:</em> Total addressable market · Revenue · MAU · DAU</li></ul>",
                "id": "c10-b6",
                "type": "list",
              },
            ],
